  "texts": {
    "preamble": "U.Srinivas Rao vs State Of Ap on 31 December, 2019 Author: C.Praveen Kumar Bench: C.Praveen Kumar The Honourable Sri Justice C.Praveen Kumar Criminal Petition No.5892 of 2019 Order:",
    "facts": "- This Criminal Petition is filed by the petitioner/accused under Section 482 of the Criminal Procedure Code, 1973 to quash the proceedings in C.C.No.59 of 2019 on the file of the learned II Additional Junior Civil Judge, Sattenapalli. The offences alleged are under Sections 188, 272, 273 and 420 I.P.C. and Sections 58, 59 and 63 of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006.",
    "arguments": "3. Learned counsel for the petitioner so also the learned Public Prosecutor would submit that the issue involved in the present case is squarely covered by the common order, dated 18.12.2019, of this Court in Criminal Petition No.5421 of 2019 and batch.",
